{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"I found the main defect: checkout decrements inventory by treating an order-product row ID as a product ID, and it only logs oversells instead of rejecting them. I’m fixing that at the service boundary, then adding atomic cart validation and one-time cancellation restoration."}}
